TITLE Calcite kinetics (built-in rate), SI Witherite at step 10 vs 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5
    Cl        30
    -water    1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0 1.0
        -step  10 in 100
        -tol   1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -si Witherite
END
